{"version":1,"content":"<p>前日本AV女優，近年轉型為DJ的濱崎真緒（DJ Mao），昨日（1日日）凌晨在尖沙嘴一間派對場所，飲用一杯飲料後不適，神志不清及身體抽搐，其經理人懷疑飲料遭落藥並報警，經理人指濱崎真緒被驗出對4種藥物呈陽性反應，一度需轉入深切治療部（ICU）留醫。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:01:28.231032+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:59:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:58:45.791203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:58:49.561350+00:00","content_hash":"e41419bc5b5ec581adc52135af1be0d47b3370a7432450718911d2d4a2fcafb4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}